commenti.body:
Forget the sound if it helps, depending on the film it's usually added at a later release. Just watch the camera, and find some that deserve your attention. You liked metropolis, look intio german expressionism in general!

&#x200B;

Also two things, contradictory haha. 1. There's nothing embarassing about not getting into silent films, the medium is so different but 2. You said it yourself, but if you don't take them seriously and look down of them/ laugh at them you will never get into them in a million years. It's obvious but, i mentioned german expressionism before, there's nothing to not take seriously. It's literally high art by pretty much all measures.
